{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Stop an otter managed running container environment{R}{2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter off  [options] [container]{R}                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter stop [options] [container]{R}                   {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter off my-box{R}                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter off --all{R}                                    {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter stop --yes my-box{R}                            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter stop --all --root{R}                            {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Stop all otters{R}                     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--name{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-n{R}  {5}Name of the container to stop{R}       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-r{R}  {5}Stop rootful containers{R}             {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}  {5}Prefer over 'sudo otter'. If you don't want{R} {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}         {5}to use 'sudo' for root escalation you can{R}   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}         {5}Set OTR_SUDO_PROGRAM to use different app.{R}  {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ See also:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Rootful containers need '--root' for 'stop' to work.{R}{2}│{R}
{2}╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯{R}
